<!--
  Oui Académie — com.ouiacademie.app

  This ONE file is both the target's INFOPLIST_FILE and a bundled resource: the
  Firebase keys and the app's Info.plist keys are merged into it (project-wide
  convention since commit a04fb560b). Do NOT overwrite it with the raw
  GoogleService-Info.plist downloaded from Firebase — that would delete every
  CFBundle*/NS*UsageDescription key below and break the build.

  To fill in the Firebase half, drop the raw download next to this file as
  GoogleService-Info.firebase.plist and run:
      ./GoogleServiceConfigs/merge-firebase-config.sh Oui-Academie

  GOOGLE_APP_ID below is a PLACEHOLDER. A target that ships with it crashes on
  launch, 100% of the time, in FirebaseApp.configure() — this exact bug shipped
  in SSDC Horizon 1.1.9 and users could not open the app for six weeks.
-->
